_meanings:
The seventh zodiacal sign from the natal sign ({#lagna#});
 {#tiTO ca jAmitraguRAnvitAyAm#} <ls>Ku. 7. 1</ls> ({#jAmitraM lagnAt saptamaM sTAnam#}
 <ls>Malli.</ls>). {%Note%}:-- Some derive the word from {#jAyA#}, because in
 astrology, the {@{#jAmitra#}@} sign indicates the future good-luck of oneʼs
 wife ({#jAyAmitram ?#}); but the word is obviously connected with the
 Greek {%diametron%}.
